{
  "slug": "jpyc-dev-reference",
  "name": "Jpyc Dev Reference",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Developer reference for JPYC, a JPY-pegged stablecoin (日本円ステーブルコイン) deployed on Ethereum, Polygon, and Avalanche. Provides\n  contract addresses, ERC20 functions, EIP-3009 gasless transfer signatures, EIP-2612 permit, admin/role operations (mint, burn, pause,\n  blocklist), EIP712 domain configuration, type hashes, error messages, and TypeScript/viem code examples.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `jpyc-ec-purchase` (Purchase products from JPYC EC Platform shops using JPYC stablecoin via x402 — one-shot HTTP-native gasless payments designed…) and **1 MCP server**, `jpyc-ec-purchase`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jpyc-dev-reference@claude-community` from `Mameta29/jpyc-skill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
